    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-07652f10e3352e3f1f344cd8",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "超前校正会增大 ωc / L(0) 的值（对于 1 型系统为 ωc / Kv）。这意味着，若保持低频增益不变，截止频率将增大；若保持截止频率不变，低频增益将减小。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Lead compensation increases the value of ωc / L(0) (= ωc / Kv for a Type 1 system). That means that, if the low-frequency gain is kept the same, the crossover frequency will increase. Or, if the crossover frequency is kept the same, the low-frequency gain will decrease.",
